        "You must verify your eligibility criteria (typically 75% or star marks and above) in the SEBA HSLC exam.",
        "Keep your SEBA Roll Number, Admit Card, and valid Bank Account details ready.",
        "Register or claim your award strictly within the announced timeline on the ARBAS portal.",
        "Ensure the bank account is registered in your or your parent's name."
